# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
**/node_modules
**/build
/.pnp
.pnp.js

# user-uploaded files
BackEnd/uploads
# assignment attachments (served only through authenticated routes)
BackEnd/private-uploads

# testing
/coverage


# misc
.DS_Store
# Ignore all .env files in any folder.
# NOTE: git does not support trailing comments on pattern lines — a comment here
# becomes part of the pattern and silently matches nothing.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/env
# Browser downloads dedupe with a suffix like "env (1)" — catch those too.
**/env (*)

# Vendor reference material, not part of the app
*.zip

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
